{"3292500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anathema's Symphony", "steam_appid": 3292500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anathema's Symphony</strong> is a top-down rhythm-shooter that combines rhythm-based combat with modern 3D graphics and a world full of lore waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/86a90603d8dd34ccf41542c8950dc43a.poster.avif?t=1787395134\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/86a90603d8dd34ccf41542c8950dc43a.webm?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/86a90603d8dd34ccf41542c8950dc43a.mp4?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/280cbabd4b902f478f52f13d45bc29ad.avif?t=1787395134\" width=531 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Combat:</strong> In Anathema's Symphony, every action is tied to the beat. Both the enemy and player attacks are synched to the rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Complexity Mechanics:</strong> Every new level reintegrates familiar mechanics and creates unique set of gameplay scenarios.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-Bending Experience:</strong> Mixing the top-down dodging with rhythm based gameplay offers unexplored take on the genre that will freshen up your experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/9bd86dd734fd3afb4893781870f29acd.poster.avif?t=1787395134\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/9bd86dd734fd3afb4893781870f29acd.webm?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/9bd86dd734fd3afb4893781870f29acd.mp4?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/b4481bd21d0102ec2857ed61b0bf0024.avif?t=1787395134\" width=531 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Too easy for you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Difficulty modifiers provide new challenges for the most skillful players. Get various rewards for completing side-quests specifically designed to torture the hell out of you (in a good way, probably)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/ac98a23bb52b6820d1e71ecfc5c1ee7d.poster.avif?t=1787395134\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/ac98a23bb52b6820d1e71ecfc5c1ee7d.webm?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/ac98a23bb52b6820d1e71ecfc5c1ee7d.mp4?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/f5487a1613c3b6a8e09a93b5a6d635fd.avif?t=1787395134\" width=531 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of your own look? Acquire new cosmetic items by progressing through achievements, completing harder areas and finding secrets. <br>Choose your look: Get luxurious, get stylish, take that hat finally off, get bald. <br> ‎ <br>‎<br>‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Get born, keep warm, cool hats, achievements</i><br><i> Learn to progress, get dressed, get blessed, try to be a success...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/2c86b1055ad4bbd0dedf872224274f06.poster.avif?t=1787395134\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/2c86b1055ad4bbd0dedf872224274f06.webm?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/2c86b1055ad4bbd0dedf872224274f06.mp4?t=1787395134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready</strong> to enter a world where rhythm and your skill are the only things that matter. With unique 3D visuals, challenging mechanics, and a musical flow that controls everything, Anathema's Symphony offers a rhythm-shooter experience unlike any other. Are you prepared?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anathema's Symphony</strong> is a top-down rhythm-shooter that combines rhythm-based combat with modern 3D graphics and a world full of lore waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli